  "title": "Pets in Apartments: Tips for Keeping Your Furry Friends Happy",
  "summary": "When searching for an apartment, you're often looking for a home that welcomes not just you, but your animal companions as well. As of 2024, 66% of households in the United States own at least one pet. Unfortunately, many apartments have very restrictive guidelines about which animals they allow—from breed restrictions to size limits. While some regulations serve a purpose, finding the perfect home shouldn't mean leaving your beloved pet behind.",
